Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 09:44:30 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] libnotificationmanager: restore app inhibitions after a
 restart

Inhibitions were only kept in plasmashell's memory, so after it crashed
or restarted, notifications showed up again while e.g. sharing a screen.
They're now saved in the runtime dir and restored if the app still runs.

BUG: 509755
---
 libnotificationmanager/server_p.cpp | 118 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 libnotificationmanager/server_p.h   |   4 +
 2 files changed, 122 insertions(+)

diff --git a/libnotificationmanager/server_p.cpp b/libnotificationmanager/server_p.cpp
index 76f91abcba..3d898f9d88 100644
--- a/libnotificationmanager/server_p.cpp
+++ b/libnotificationmanager/server_p.cpp
@@ -21,6 +21,10 @@

 #include <QDBusConnection>
 #include <QDBusServiceWatcher>
